    }
  ]
}
```

## Local Coder Failure To Avoid
- reason_code: STATIC_IMPORT_CLASSIC_SCRIPT
- blocked_reason: Prompt 3 model output rejected before apply: STATIC_IMPORT_CLASSIC_SCRIPT
- needed_context: Regenerate Prompt 3 with coherent products.js module wiring: static import requires index.html type="module" script wiring, while classic script loading requires dynamic import('./products.js').

